       "p": "$$\\frac{d}{dx}\\text{ tan}^{-1} y = \\frac{dy/dx}{1 + y^{2}} = (1 - x^{2})^{-3/2}(1 - x^{2}) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}}$$",
       "display": true
      },
      {
       "p": "Why is this the same as the derivative of sin$^{-1} x$?"
      }
     ]
    },
